  "details": "I'm a person who doesn't like the way their sound and also am super anxious. But many others might be the same as me or are medically mute. I don't know how hard it would be to implement something like this but me personally I'd like it so I don't have to use TTS Voice Wizard and use a virtual audio cable to make it work. different voices can be locked behind VRC+ not really something I mind but I would like default voices for like male and female for people who want to sound like a male or female or just people who like playing as a female in game or opposite.",
